This repository develops the general mathematics instantiated by two
sibling repositories under the same license:

  - regional-obstruction-calculus
    https://github.com/dhwcmoore/regional-obstruction-calculus

  - proof-carrying-exactness
    https://github.com/dhwcmoore/proof-carrying-exactness

lift-descent-exactness has no code dependency on either repository. The
relationship is mathematical (they instantiate the theory developed here),
not architectural.
